ose values are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returned. The dense solver below 64 vertices, or when k is a third of them or more.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"O((n + m) · products + n · k²) time, O(n · k) ","type":"text"},{"code":"Double","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s for the vectors and n · max(30, 2k +","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"10) for the basis.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"weight","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" gives the weight of the edge at each position, read once per position; a weight of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"0 is no edge."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","name":"Precondition","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"smallest","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is in ","type":"text"},{"code":"0...vertexCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"tolerance > 0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", every weight is finite","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and nonnegative, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxIterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", when given, is at least 1.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NoConvergence"},{"type":"text","text":" when a Lanczos run spends "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"type":"text","text":" products without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"converging, with the products spent and the largest Ritz residual on the tolerance’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scale. The dense solver throws as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"adjacencySpectrum"},{"type":"text","text":" does."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/S